ted widget matches a direct draw. ImageGraphics2D sends image draws (DrawImage, every quality path) and the gradient, pattern and filtered-image fills through StraightOverDestination, whose StraightOverImageProxy now blends colour spans straight-over too, under the destination's clip box. Two consumers that relied on the old premultiplied blit follow the straight rule: a rounded backbuffer's clipped corner fades only its alpha (RoundedClipCoverage.Apply; it darkened the colour too, which a straight reader showed as a dark rim), and a faded backbuffer composited by the CPU is built straight (WidgetBackbuffer.DestinationBlendsPremultiplied is now true only for LcdBufferGraphics2D), so half opacity lands half way instead of dark. New ImageGraphics2DTranslucentImageTests: whole-pixel, scaled and fractional draws over opaque white, the same on a transparent backbuffer composited against a direct draw, translucent gradient and pattern fills, and clipping.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"elsa-workflows/elsa-core","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-03T17:58:14Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"e07d2e3a3502c24611c8272cd3e2cb25a00f9ed5","github_link":"https://github.com/elsa-workflows/elsa-core/commit/e07d2e3a3502c24611c8272cd3e2cb25a00f9ed5","commit_subject":"fix(studio): scope permission refresh and make cache generation atomic","ai_tool":"Cursor"},{"repo_name":"StoDevX/AAO-React-Native","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-03T17:58:07Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"1641c94b1a5adda5804ef88578557b3cedbc6a9c","github_link":"https://github.com/StoDevX/AAO-React-Native/commit/1641c94b1a5adda5804ef88578557b3cedbc6a9c","commit_subject":"Put feedback and email first on Contributing, and credit KRLX","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"ClickHouse/ClickHouse","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-03T17:58:04Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"9862cd9565404c213c28bbc977b92b7ff822ab8e","github_link":"https://github.com/ClickHouse/ClickHouse/commit/9862cd9565404c213c28bbc977b92b7ff822ab8e","commit_subject":"Pi